## The root's column

Line 16, `PNode 120%Z`, starts at column 0; the other trees of lib/CJ/RL/GX and GXA (vsnprintf, vsprintf,
snprintf, sprintf, towrite, vfprintf) start their root at column 2. `--root-indent 0` moves the root's own line
only. Without it (default 2) the output differs from lines 15-81 in line 16 only: `-PNode 120%Z` /
`+  PNode 120%Z` (sha256 cd3544ea052e54b298a7879e6f12125564df964220013dca1a058643a5326fd7).

## Verdict

BYTE-EQUAL on both of the unit's pins (fuzz_command.plain and fuzz_command.ubsan). On the other two pins of the
build (fuzz_command.asan, fuzz_command.asan-ubsan) the output is the same bytes. Lines 15-81 are the output of
ptree_emit.py (sha256 000e02022cc9d7fdc7a84ce4f62959039a57c2c1a13d601880297c2739c408a7) on the unit's pins.
